Reallocated_Sector_Ct > 0 = disk is remapping bad sectors. Not dead, but dying.
Current_Pending_Sector > 0 = sectors that failed reads and are pending reallocation. Bad sign.
Offline_Uncorrectable > 0 = unrecoverable errors. Very bad.
UDMA_CRC_Error_Count > 0 = bad SATA cable / connector (intermittent!).
NVMe Percentage Used > 80% = drive is wearing out.
NVMe Media and Data Integrity Errors > 0 = bad.
