Can Prometheus cause a spike like this? Yes, in principle.
Prometheus does scrape a lot on every interval:

All node-exporter pods (6 nodes × ~1000 metrics)
All kubelet cadvisor endpoints (6 × thousands of metrics)
kube-state-metrics (one endpoint, but huge response — thousands of lines for your cluster)
