Apiserver recovers
         ↓
Prometheus + all controllers + kubelet heartbeats ALL retry at once
         ↓
Read burst hits etcd
         ↓
Visible spike
This explains the "why only sometimes" — the primary event is sporadic, and Prometheus retries make it worse when it happens.

