kube-state-metrics — watches apiserver for pod/deployment/node state, exports as Prometheus metrics
Prometheus itself — watches apiserver for service discovery (to know what to scrape)
Flux controllers — watch apiserver for GitOps resources
Promtail — uses apiserver to discover which pods it should scrape logs from (via service discovery)
Each of these maintains a persistent "watch" connection to apiserver, not a stream of polls. Lightweight when idle, heavy during reconciliation storms.

